<title>USA: Missouri direct hogs steady - USDA.</title>
<headline>Missouri direct hogs steady - USDA.</headline>
<dateline>JEFFERSON CITY 1997-07-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Barrows and gilts were</p>
<p>steady. Top $59.00 per cwt. - USDA</p>
<p>US 1-3   230-260 lbs    57.00-59.00</p>
<p>US 2-3   260-270 lbs    56.00-57.00</p>
<p>	   270-280 lbs    55.00-56.00</p>
<p>Sows steady to 2.00 higher. Top 48.00.</p>
<p>US 1-3   300-500 lbs    41.00-43.00</p>
<p>	  over 500 lbs    45.00-48.00</p>
</text>
